          "label_cn": "连续的一段；一连串同类事件、结果或表现；性格中的一面；明显的倾向或特质；条纹；细长的线、痕迹或带状部分",
          "label_en": "an uninterrupted series or run of similar events, results, or behavior; a noticeable tendency or characteristic in someone's personality; a long, thin line, mark, strip, or band of a different color or material",
