      ],
      "core_meaning_cn": "显出的细长条痕；也指性格中一股倾向或连续一段经历；动词可指留下条痕、飞速掠过或裸奔。",
      "core_meaning_en": "an uninterrupted series or run of similar events, results, or behavior; a noticeable tendency or characteristic in someone's personality; a long, thin line, mark, strip, or band of a different color or material",
      "mental_model_cn": "颜色或污迹看条痕；personality看性格倾向；连续结果看一连串；动词搭方向看快移，公众裸体语境才是裸奔。",
